SYNTHETIC – a trace log of 200 lines (LF) of exactly 300 characters each, 60,000 characters of
line text in total (US1-4); line n reads "... node1 record <n, three digits> payload" followed by
"field<n>=value;" repeated up to 300 characters.
Expected from LogExcerpt.build with tailLines 200: maxChars 20,000 keeps the newest 66 lines
(135–200, 19,800 characters) and drops 134; maxChars 299 keeps only line 200, cut to 299
characters (droppedLines 199, cutLines 1).
Used by LogExcerptTest (tasks.md T015, research D-12).
